sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Trigger as External trigger
    participant BCO as BCO
    participant Registry as Trigger registry
    participant Profile as Campaign execution profile
    participant Store as BCO State store

    Trigger->>BCO: Submit Campaign Request JSON
    BCO->>Registry: Authenticate trigger
    BCO->>BCO: Validate request shape and required fields
    BCO->>BCO: Check good and bad boundary fields are present
    BCO->>BCO: Resolve composition name (CR or default)
    BCO->>Profile: Check deployment capability (regression type, search policy, composition, evidence path)
    alt unsupported capability or incomplete request
        BCO-->>Trigger: Reject with validation errors
    else request accepted by capability checks
        BCO->>BCO: Compute campaign equivalence key
        BCO->>Store: Atomic create or join by equivalence key
        alt equivalent campaign exists
            Store-->>BCO: Existing active or completed campaign reference
            BCO-->>Trigger: Return existing campaign reference
        else new campaign
            Store-->>BCO: Campaign created in running state
            BCO-->>Trigger: Campaign accepted
        end
    end
